  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      741.64,
      554.99,
      780.1
    ],
    "text": "Strong winds of about (40-50) kmph can be expected at times over North-central, Sabaragamuwa, Southern, Central and North-western provinces and Trincomalee district.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
